<title>FRANCE: France Telecom to join CAC index.</title>
<headline>France Telecom to join CAC index.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom will enter the CAC 40 index, as well as the SBF 120 and SBF 250, when the stock is listed, the French stock markets association SBF said on Monday.</p>
<p>Due to the exceptional size of France Telecom's planned stock market flotation, its weighting in the indices will be decided at a later meeting of the SBF Scientific Council, the Societe des Bourses Francaises said in a statement.</p>
</text>
